{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Trace_ppx</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"elpi","href":"../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Trace_ppx","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>elpi.trace.ppx provides the following syntax extensions:</p><pre class=\"language-ocaml\"><code>\u000Atype t = { a : T; b : S [@trace] }\u000A\u000Alet rec f x (w[@trace]) =\u000A [%trace &quot;f&quot; (fun fmt -&gt; .. x ..) begin\u000A     match x with\u000A     | K1 -&gt; ...\u000A     | K2 x -&gt; [%tcall f x]\u000A     | K2(x,y) -&gt;\u000A        let z = f x in\u000A        [%spy &quot;z&quot; ~rid ~gid ~cond (fun fmt z -&gt; .. z ..) z];\u000A        [%spyl &quot;z&quot; ~rid ~gid ~cond (fun fmt z -&gt; .. z ..) zs];\u000A        [%log &quot;K2&quot; ~rid &quot;whatever&quot; 37];\u000A        let x[@trace] = ... in e\u000A        let w = { a; b = b[@trace ] } in\u000A        match w with\u000A        | { a; b = b [@trace] } -&gt;\u000A           z + f y (b[@trace])\u000A end]\u000A\u000A[%end_trace &quot;stop&quot; ~rid]\u000A</code></pre><p>If --cookie &quot;elpi_trace=\\&quot;true\\&quot;&quot; is not passed to the ppx rewriter:</p><ul><li><code>[%end_trace &quot;stop&quot; ~rid]</code> ---&gt; <code>()</code></li><li><code>[%trace &quot;foo&quot; pp code]</code> ---&gt; <code>code</code></li><li><code>[%tcall f x]</code> ---&gt; <code>f x</code></li><li><code>[%spy ...]</code> <code>[%spyl ...]</code> and <code>[%log ...]</code> ---&gt; <code>()</code></li><li><code>f x (y[@trace]) z</code> ---&gt; <code>f x z</code></li><li><code>let x[@trace] = .. in e</code> ---&gt; <code>e</code></li><li><code>type x = { a : T; b : T [@trace] }</code> ---&gt; <code>type x = { a : T }</code></li><li><code>{ a; b = b [@trace] }</code> ---&gt; <code>{ a }</code> (in both patterns and expressions)</li><li><code>T -&gt; (S[@trace]) -&gt; U</code> ---&gt; <code>T -&gt; U</code></li></ul><p>In records, the shorcut &quot;x&quot; to mean &quot;x = x&quot; does not work, you have to use the longer form.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-err\"><a href=\"#val-err\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> err : <span><span class=\"label\">loc</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppxlib</span>.Location.t <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-trace\"><a href=\"#val-trace\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> trace : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">rid</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppxlib_ast</span>.Ast.expression <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">loc</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppxlib</span>.location <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppxlib_ast</span>.Ast.expression <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppxlib_ast</span>.Ast.expression <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppxlib_ast</span>.Ast.expression <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppxlib_ast</span>.Ast.expression</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-spy\"><a href=\"#val-spy\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> spy : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">loc</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppxlib</span>.location <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><span class=\"label\">loc</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppxlib</span>.location <span class=\"arro